# Date-time helpers (pure tinct, depends on builtins)
[days-between@[doc: "Calculate days between two timestamps"]: [fn [a b] [duration->seconds [timestamp-diff b a]]]
 timestamp-in-range?@[doc: "Check if a timestamp is within a range"]: [fn [t start end] [and [timestamp<? start t] [timestamp<? t end]]]]
